# Spiked wheels (spec M4c): guns.scenario's way into the race and its half turn with the test
# game given spikes (--save 0:FILE with the player's spikes at 1), then Up held so the car
# drives its front into the car behind. A shot every 100 ms; run with --no-ai --watch.
